        "data-press-copy-target": "press-short-text",
        "href": "#press-short-text"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d008fc",
      "text": {
        "html": "<h3 class=\"press-subtitle\">Extended description · 150 words</h3>",
        "text": "Extended description · 150 words"
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d008fe",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-copy-text\">Apropos Magazine explores the culture that fills stages, screens, pages and conversations. The independent Danish publication brings together reviews, essays and commentary on music, film, television, books, art, gaming and cultural life.</p>",
        "text": "Apropos Magazine explores the culture that fills stages, screens, pages and conversations. The independent Danish publication brings together reviews, essays and commentary on music, film, television, books, art, gaming and cultural life."
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d00900",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-copy-text\">Its music coverage includes concerts, festivals and releases. Film and television are considered as storytelling, while books, art and games form part of a wider conversation about aesthetics, identity and society. There is room for both an individual work and the context around it. The editorial voice is personal, curious and open to humour, aiming to make culture matter and welcome fresh perspectives.</p>",
        "text": "Its music coverage includes concerts, festivals and releases. Film and television are considered as storytelling, while books, art and games form part of a wider conversation about aesthetics, identity and society. There is room for both an individual work and the context around it. The editorial voice is personal, curious and open to humour, aiming to make culture matter and welcome fresh perspectives."
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d00902",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-copy-text\">Apropos is free to read and carries no advertisements, native advertising or sponsored editorial content. Being free of advertising is a tangible part of its identity, both in the reading experience and in its editorial content.</p>",
        "text": "Apropos is free to read and carries no advertisements, native advertising or sponsored editorial content. Being free of advertising is a tangible part of its identity, both in the reading experience and in its editorial content."
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d00904",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-copy-text\">Published by Apropos Creative ApS, Apropos Magazine is for readers seeking judgments and perspectives across many forms of culture.</p>",
        "text": "Published by Apropos Creative ApS, Apropos Magazine is for readers seeking judgments and perspectives across many forms of culture."
      },
      "attributes": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
