    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d0091d",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-area-text\">Reviews of films and TV series alongside perspectives on their stories, characters and themes. From an individual release to its place in the wider culture.</p>",
        "text": "Reviews of films and TV series alongside perspectives on their stories, characters and themes. From an individual release to its place in the wider culture."
