      "type": "text",
      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d00923",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-area-text\">Exhibitions, artists and visual expression. Coverage includes portraiture, installations and design, where a work's form meets questions about the body, identity and public life.</p>",
        "text": "Exhibitions, artists and visual expression. Coverage includes portraiture, installations and design, where a work's form meets questions about the body, identity and public life."
