      "id": "93cff143-c674-9c0b-d261-d04567d00929",
      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-area-text\">Book reviews and literary perspectives that consider language, storytelling and the human and social questions raised by literature.</p>",
        "text": "Book reviews and literary perspectives that consider language, storytelling and the human and social questions raised by literature."
