      "text": {
        "html": "<p class=\"press-area-text\">Game reviews and perspectives on games as culture. Storytelling, aesthetics and gameplay inform assessments of the worlds that games invite players to explore.</p>",
        "text": "Game reviews and perspectives on games as culture. Storytelling, aesthetics and gameplay inform assessments of the worlds that games invite players to explore."
